   ],
   "flags": {},
   "order": 23,
   "mode": 0,
   "inputs": [],
   "outputs": [],
   "title": "Note: LynnReal Standard 4-step DMD",
   "properties": {},
   "widgets_values": [
    "## LynnReal Standard · 4-step DMD (v2v continuation)\n\nTwo outputs:\n\n- `SaveVideo` (raw): the model output, which starts with the 22 anchored\n  source frames followed by the generated tail.\n- `SaveVideo` (stitched): the untouched source clip with the generated tail\n  appended, scaled to the source resolution.\n\nThe stitched soundtrack is built explicitly because `ConcatenateVideo`\nrequires compatible chunks: silence across the source span, then the\ngenerated audio trimmed to the new frames. If your source clip has its own\naudio you like, feed it into `AudioConcat.audio1` instead of `EmptyAudio`.\n\n**Precision — INT8 (optional)**\n\nThe **`Use INT8 model?`** switch above the loader (default **off**) swaps `UNETLoader` from\n`lynnreal_omni_standard_bf16.safetensors` to `lynnreal_omni_standard_int8.safetensors`. Same\nW8A8 contract as the release's `--precision int8` path: per-output-channel weight scales,\nper-token activation scales, INT32 accumulate; block 0, the last block, the token refiner,\nadaLN and the IO projections stay BF16.\n\n**Links**\n\n- Code: https://github.com/LynnReal-AI/LynnReal-Omni\n- Paper: https://huggingface.co/papers/2609.15863\n- Weights: https://huggingface.co/stdstu123/LynnReal-Onmi-beta-0.1\n"
   ]
  },
